Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:46:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Switch (devkitA64/libnx) platform support: first pass

REX_PLATFORM_SWITCH, GCC allowed for Switch, no SDL3 (nop/stub audio, input,
UI), static rexruntime, offline XAM net stub, VI surface placeholder.
Originally written by Kimi; reviewed by Claude.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
